Currently we have this code:

```js
  const moduleKind = await determineModuleKind(compiledPathsDirectory);

  const transpiler = new Transpiler(
    nodePath.join(modulesPath, "paths").replaceAll("\\", "/"),
    compiledPathsDirectory,
    moduleKind,
